    <briefdescription>
<para>Handler for managing a circular FIFO buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This structure acts as a handle to an internal FIFO context.</para>
<para>It is not meant to be accessed or modified directly by user code; all operations must be performed via the API functions. </para>
